# The hosted relay and its console live in a separate private repository:
# a separate private repository. They are ignored here rather than
# merely absent, because both directories still exist in a working copy that was
# split from the monorepo — and a single `git add -A` would put the sellable
# service back into the repository that is intended to be published. Do not
# remove these two lines to "tidy up".
/relay/
/console/
